Enable Zephyr as an OS flavour of the NXP UWB IoT middleware (v04.08.01)

Adds UWBIOT_OS_ZEPHYR next to UWBIOT_OS_FREERTOS / UWBIOT_OS_NATIVE,
enables the CCC (Aliro) feature, which is off in the stock configuration, and
guards __DEPRECATED, which the Zephyr C library headers define as well.
The Zephyr OSAL itself lives in nxp_uwb_platform/osal/.

Applied by CMake to the staged copy of the NXP "libs" tree, never to the
user's extracted package.

--- a/libs/halimpl/inc/uwb_iot_ftr_default.h
+++ b/libs/halimpl/inc/uwb_iot_ftr_default.h
@@ -216,14 +216,18 @@
  */
 
 /** running with FreeRTOS Implementation. Direct or Simulation. */
-#define UWBIOT_OS_FREERTOS 1
+#define UWBIOT_OS_FREERTOS 0
 
 /** Native Implementation. Using pthread */
 #define UWBIOT_OS_NATIVE 0
 
+/** Zephyr Implementation */
+#define UWBIOT_OS_ZEPHYR 1
+
 #if (( 0                             \
     + UWBIOT_OS_FREERTOS             \
     + UWBIOT_OS_NATIVE               \
+    + UWBIOT_OS_ZEPHYR               \
     ) > 1)
 #        error "Enable only one of 'UWBIOT_OS'"
 #endif
